Error [jet.ViewOutlivesOwner]: `window` must borrow from its declared `from` sources
  --> Tests/UI/view_from_param_escape.jet:7:16
    |
  7 |     use_window(window, packet)
    |                ^^^^^^
 Why: This argument's view owners are outside the sources named after `from`
 Fix: Pass a view derived from those sources, or widen the `from` clause
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2305
